  "releaseNotes": "AIKernel.Core package family v0.1.0.1 - Patch release aligned with official AIKernel.NET contract packages v0.1.0. Core provides Result/Option/Either, ResultStep/ReplayLog semantics, DSL and ROM runtime adapters, Kernel orchestration, Provider integration, Core-owned MemoryRegion/MemoryMapper runtime adapters, and Kernel provider-routing facade helpers. GPU and Native ABI implementations remain external Capability packages.",
